OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday brings sunny spells and
OL,7,Fscattered showers, heaviest in the
OL,8,Fsoutheast. Sunday is mostly dry with
OL,9,Fsunshine, though rain reaching the
OL,10,Fnorthwest later. Monday sees
OL,11,Fincreasing rain, with breezy
OL,12,Fconditions.
